\[C_{feed}(p_{\rm T})={\rm p0}\cdot e^{-({\rm p1}/p_{\rm T})^{{\rm p2}}}, \tag{5.1}\]

in each \(Mult\) slice (Fig. 5.1), and then to fit these parameters to determine their centrality dependence (Fig. 5.2). It is then possible to construct the \(2D\) function,

\[C_{feed}(p_{\rm T},Mult)=({\rm p0}+{\rm p1}\cdot Mult)\cdot e^{-(({\rm p2}+{ \rm p3}\cdot Mult)/p_{\rm T})^{({\rm p4}+{\rm p5}\cdot Mult)}}, \tag{5.2}\]

