* [TPC] The time projection chamber provides the tracking for STAR as well as low-\(p_{\rm T}\) charged particle identification. vi, 30-35, 37, 38, 40-42, 49, 54, 61
* [UrQMD] A Monte Carlo event generator with no partonic phase. ix, 46, 47, 62, 89, 90, 96-99

